        "correct": false,
        "why": "`set_ylim` allows it."
      },
      {
        "text": "Negative values would vanish",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "There are none here."
      },
      {
        "text": "It looks tidier",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "It is about truth, not tidiness."
      }
    ]
  },
